{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もお昼からずっとレッスンで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はレッスンがハードです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん学ぶことあって、もっともっと頑張らなきゃ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/21/8059595/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんはもう夏休みですか？何して過ごすのカナ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん？特に予定ないって？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それならっ(ノ*゜ー゜)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7月28日に名古屋で乃木坂46がCBCラジオまつりに出演します♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったら旅行がてら来てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/21/8059595/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/21/8059595/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと8月10日、明治外苑花火大会に出演させていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/21/8059595/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、ぜひ来て一緒に夏を楽しみましょう(o^∀^o)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと昨日書き忘れちゃいましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7/20はゆったんのお誕生でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/21/8059595/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が一番最初におめでとうを言ったんですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/21/8059595/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忘れないうちに前日に言いました(￣ー￣)b"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日もみんなでお祝いして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいしいケーキを一瞬でいただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんにケーキを狙ってる私の写真を撮られていて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見たらほんとに真剣な顔してました(^w^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんはいつもノリがよくて、一緒にいると明るくなる♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時々おさわりしてきそうになるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は絶対ガードします！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもいっぱい話して、いっぱいふざけようね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/21/8059595/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヾ(´・∀・)ノ << Happy Birthday☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"着物でみなみと♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/erika.ikuta/img/2012/07/22/%E3%81%84%E3%81%8F%E3%81%9F%EF%BC%94.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}